# Binary assets must never have line endings rewritten.
#
# Git's autocrlf conversion treats a file as text unless told otherwise. A PDF or
# an xlsx that has had LF rewritten to CRLF on checkout is a corrupt file -- and
# the corruption appears only on the machine that checked it out, so it survives
# review and CI and shows up as "the sample download is broken" for one person.
*.pdf   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.png   binary
*.pptx  binary
*.pem   binary
